  "ideaOldWestStep2": "Use dusty midtones and avoid highly saturated accents.",
  "ideaOldWestStep3": "Push shadows with muted browns instead of pure black.",
  "ideaOldWestStep4": "Reserve highlights for worn edges and sun hit points.",
  "ideaOldWestEmbellishment1": "Add subtle grain dots in empty regions for aged texture.",
  "ideaOldWestEmbellishment2": "Use broken edges on highlights to mimic worn print paper.",
