  "ideaMidnightOverview": "Night conversion depends on cooler shadows, lower values, and sparse light accents.",
  "ideaMidnightStep1": "Convert warm daytime areas into cooler night tones.",
  "ideaMidnightStep2": "Push sky/background values darker than midground.",
  "ideaMidnightStep3": "Add moonlight accents on top-facing edges.",
  "ideaMidnightStep4": "Soften distant elements to increase nocturnal depth.",
  "ideaMidnightEmbellishment1": "Keep highlights cool and sparse to avoid reintroducing daytime feel.",
  "ideaMidnightEmbellishment2": "Darken corners more than center to create natural nighttime framing.",
